<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.3.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02120</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.3.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>03207c03-e88f-4950-b98c-6af926b2fd04</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para class="os-raise-text-bold"><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1 - 2, determine the number of solutions. Then solve the equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(3x^2=48\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 0 solutions </item>
  <item> 1 solution; \(x=4\) </item>
  <item> 2 solutions; \(x=4\) and \(x=-4\) </item>
  <item> 2 solutions; \(x=12\) and \(x=-12\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 2 solutions; \(x=4\) and \(x=-4\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((x+2)(x+2)=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 0 solutions </item>
  <item> 1 solution; \(x=-2\) </item>
  <item> 1 solution; \(x=2\) </item>
  <item> 2 solutions; \(x=2\) and \(x=-2\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 1 solution; \(x=-2\)</para>
<para>For questions 3 – 10, solve the quadratic equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4m^2=36\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(m=3\) and \(m=-3\) </item>
  <item>\( m=3\) </item>
  <item>\( m=9\) and \(m=-9\) </item>
  <item> \(m=2\) and \(m=-2\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(m=3\) and \(m=-3\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(d^2-25=0\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item>\(d=5\) and \(d=-5\) </item>
  <item> \(d=5\) </item>
  <item> \(d=-5\) </item>
  <item> \(d=25\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(d=5\) and \(d=-5\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(\frac{2}{3}z^2=54\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(z=6\) and \(z=-6\) </item>
  <item> \(z=7\) and \(z=-9\) </item>
  <item> \(z=9\) and \(z=-9\) </item>
  <item> \(z=7\) and \(z=-7\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(z=9\) and \(z=-9\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4p^2+10=266\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(p =18\) and \(p=-18\) </item>
  <item> \(p =12\) and \(p=-12\) </item>
  <item> \(p =16\) and \(p=-16\)  </item>
  <item> \(p =8\) and \(p=-8\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(p =8\) and \(p=-8\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((a−7)^2+5=105\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(a=17\) and \(a=-3\) </item>
  <item> \(a=-17\) and \(a=3\) </item>
  <item> \(a=-10\) and \(a=10\) </item>
  <item> \(a=3\) and \(a=-3\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(a=17\) and \(a=-3\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((b−1)^2−9=55\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(b=9\) and \(b=-9\) </item>
  <item>\( b=8\) and \(b=-8\) </item>
  <item> \(b=9\) and \(b=-7\) </item>
  <item> \(b=-9\) and \(b=7\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(b =9\) and \(b=-7\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(\frac17(x+3)^2−5=2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item>\(
    x=-4\) and \(x=10\) </item>
  <item> \(x=4\) and \(x=-10\) </item>
  <item> \(x=-4\) and \(x=4\) </item>
  <item> \(x=-2\) and \(x=12\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x =4\) and \(x=-10\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(5(x−8)^2−7=118\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(x=13\) and \(x=3\) </item>
  <item> \(x=-3\) and \(x=-13\) </item>
  <item> \(x=5\) and \(x=-5\) </item>
  <item>\(x=5\) and \(x=-11\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x=13\) and \(x=3\)</para></section>
</content>
